  {
   "id": "limits",
   "kicker": "04",
   "title": "Pushing Too Hard",
   "intro": "Guidance strength is a trade-off. Past the operating point, strong EBT guidance flattens the model's choice among attribute values: the target is reached by scattering near-random notes. Harsh dissonance (share of simultaneous note pairs a semitone, major seventh or tritone apart) rises to the level of uniformly random notes, about 0.25.",
